ting Syllabus (2\u2011Year Structure)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Year \/ Semester<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><td><strong>Type of Subjects<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><td><strong>Example Topics<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Year 1 \u2013 Semester 1&nbsp;<\/td><td>Core Management&nbsp;<\/td><td>Marketing Management, Managerial Economics, Business Analytics, Organizational&nbsp;Behaviour&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Year 1 \u2013 Semester 2&nbsp;<\/td><td>Foundation &amp; Digital Intro&nbsp;<\/td><td>Digital Business Models, Consumer&nbsp;Behaviour&nbsp;(Online), Basics of SEO &amp; Social Media&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Year 2 \u2013 Semester 3&nbsp;<\/td><td>Core Digital Marketing&nbsp;<\/td><td>SEO, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/search-engine-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEM<\/a> \/ <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-ppc\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">PPC<\/a>, Social Media Marketing, Email Marketing, Content Strategy&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Year 2 \u2013 Semester 4&nbsp;<\/td><td>Advanced &amp; Strategy&nbsp;<\/td><td>Advanced Analytics, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/marketing-automation\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Marketing Automation<\/a>, Digital Campaign Planning, Capstone Project \/ Internship\u00a0<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Digital Marketing Course Eligibility&nbsp;2026<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-eligibility\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing course eligibility<\/a>&nbsp;is:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Candidates with a marketing, advertising, and content creation degree can&nbsp;quickly sign&nbsp;up for a digital marketing course.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>For a basic digital marketing certification course, an individual must&nbsp;complete&nbsp;10+2 with 50% in any stream.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>If an individual wants to pursue a diploma in digital marketing, they must have an aggregate of 50% in class 12.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>If an individual aims to pursue a postgraduate diploma in digital marketing, they must have 50% marks in graduation from any discipline.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>To get a BBA degree in digital marketing, the candidate must get 50% in 12th standard in any stream from a recognized board.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Suppose a person wants an MSc or MBA in digital marketing; in such case, they need to have 50% marks overall in graduation from any discipline from a recognized college or university.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-a88cc304cfbf56ecc2dbaf8074fb2c4f\"><strong>Read More Important Digital Marketing Guides<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">What is Digital Marketing?<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/email-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">What is Email Marketing?<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-ppc\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">What is PPC? Pay-Per-Click<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/