er","text":"A basic syllabus covers SEO, social media ads, and Google Analytics, while an advanced digital marketing course syllabus adds AI tools, automation, and complex analytics. Both aim to prepare you for\u00a0real-world\u00a0campaigns.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1779096711279","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1779096711279","name":"5. How long should the syllabus take me to complete?\u00a0","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The learning time depends on the program: short certificates run 4\u20138 weeks, while diploma and advanced courses span 3\u201312 months. The digital marketing course syllabus and digital marketing course information usually mention a clear weekly breakdown.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1779096722555","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1779096722555","name":"6. Do I get practical projects in the syllabus?\u00a0","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes; most modern syllabi include live projects like\u00a0SEO\u00a0optimizing\u00a0a website, running Google Ads, or creating a social media plan. These projects help you apply the digital marketing course syllabus directly to real campaigns.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1779096733620","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1779096733620","name":"7. How do I check digital marketing course fees and syllabus together?\u00a0","answerCount":1,"acceptedA